{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MddbcjcBuFBmKNcjCuE43P","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 contamcal-irt-calibration 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (131 个)\\n\\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_3B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_eval_15B_d000_s42**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_r3**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42_v2**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_d005_05B**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_100pct_05B**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_3B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_injection**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B_s123**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_15B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp_001_sft_0pct_05B**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_confounding**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_sim_4pl_gamma**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp_001_eval_3B_d100_v2_s123_aligned | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp_001_eval_3B_d025_v2_aligned | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp006-s1only-gsm8k-2pl | GSM8K S1-only 2PL+γ. Previous S1-only 4PL+γ gave γ=0.12 (non-significant). If 2PL makes S1 signal significant, demonstrates 4PL overparameterization absorbs weak signal — evidence for model selection mattering. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp_003_mmlu_item_aligned_gap（准备中）\\n- exp006-gsm8k-d024-delta（准备中）\\n- exp_006_irt_05B_v2: Tiered IRT calibration (D023): GSM8K/ARC direct NUTS + MMLU subsampled 1000 items + ADVI robustness check. Fixes v1 issues: aligned-only, signal-derived exposure, --max-items.（准备中）\\n- exp_008_instruct_rl_proxy: RL proxy experiment (D021 Problem 3): Use Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct (SFT+RL post-trained) as RL regime data point. 3-regime comparison: base (pretrained) → d000 (SFT) → Instruct (SFT+RL). C