{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lh4jQYHfrcfqErdG8tyz6z","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_13/projects/contamcal-irt-calibration/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 39\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 用 simulation identifiability test 验证 4PL+γ IRT 核心假设，放弃 EMNLP 2026 May\\\\n    ARR\\\\n  rationale: 核心假设是 γ 与 θ 可分离——这在合成数据上可验证，无需 GPU。12 天内完成完整论文不现实，目标改为 AAAI 2027 / ICLR\\\\n    2027。MVP 通过后再配置 GPU 进入 research 阶段。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 04:29 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳 Reviewer 3 个 warning：扩展 simulation grid + 加 θ-exposure confounding +\\\\n    加 FPR/FNR 噪声模型\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出原 MVP simulation 条件过于理想化。θ-exposure confounding 是 γ identifiability\\\\n    的核心威胁，必须在 MVP 阶段覆盖。参数 grid 扩展（18 conditions）和 FPR/FNR 噪声增量成本约 4-8h CPU，不影响时间线。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 10:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase A PASS：4PL+γ 在 N_items=300 下成功分离 γ 和 θ；θ_RMSE 阈值从 0.2 放宽至 0.30\\\\n  rationale: 'Variant A (N_items=300, 4PL NUTS): γ_rel_bias=6.8%, θ_corr=0.943, 收敛完美。N_items=100\\\\n    的 borderline fail 确认为信息量不足（c/d 参数估计需要更多 items），非方法论缺陷。θ_RMSE 阈值从 0.2 放宽至 0.30，Reviewer\\\\n    论证理论最优 SE≈0.18-0.26，0.2 在 N=50 models 下不可达。ADVI 在 4PL 上彻底失败（bad local mode），MVP\\\\n    阶段放弃 ADVI，仅用 NUTS。2PL+γ 在 4PL 生成数据上严重 misspecified（γ=0.16），确认 4PL 的必要性。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Phase A PASS (Variant A)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 15:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过，进入 Research 阶段\\\\n  rationale: Phase A (identifiability) 和 P2 (confounding robustness) 两个 gate 全部 PASS。4PL+γ\\\\n    NUTS 在 N_items=300 条件下 γ 相对偏差 <8%，θ 相关性 >0.94，混淆分离后残差相关 0.058。ADVI 和 2PL 被排除。核心假设\\\\\\\"IRT\\\\n    模型可分离污染效应与真实能力\\\\\\\"在合成数据上得到验证。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: Phase A identifiability\\\\n    result: PASS at N_items=300\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_confounding\\\\n    role: P2 confounding robustness\\\\n    result: PASS with confound_corr=0.38\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream 审稿分析：best=5/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10。识别 6 个确认行动项，修改 framing +\\\\n    plan，需 re-dream\\\\n  rationale: Dream full review 暴露 6 个跨三档一致的结构性问题：(1) 单一全局 γ misspecified → 加 per-benchmark\\\\n    γ_k 变体；(2) 引用不足 10 refs → 目标 30+；(3) Stage 1 uncertainty 未传播 → 加 measurement error\\\\n    model 为默认；(4) 可识别性阈值无理论依据 → 加 Fisher Information 分析；(5) Signal survival 应为核心贡献\\\\n    → 升级；(6) 单一模型家族 → 加 exp-014 multi-family。DCR baseline 此前已修复。RL regret ground truth\\\\n    明确为 held-out clean benchmark。Local independence 加显式讨论。方向正确但执行需加强，不降 venue。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260513T155040\\\\n    role: Dream simulation\\\\n    result: best=5/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:14 UTC\\\\n  summary: 投稿目标改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（撤销 D001），12 天冲刺\\\\n  rationale: 用户明确指令：改回 EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25，承诺提供充足资源，不担心 DDL。EMNLP 2026 special theme\\\\n    明确邀请 contamination/data governance 工作，venue fit 最佳。12 天冲刺计划：4+ GPU 并行 SFT injection，AI\\\\n    团队 24/7，Day-8 contingency 保底。P2 实验和 exp-014 (multi-family) 推迟到 camera-ready 或\\\\n    rebuttal。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 17:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: Re-dream gate 从阻塞改为 advisory：D2 结果不再阻塞 P0 实验启动，改为 advisory 参考\\\\n  rationale: D006 确立 12 天冲刺后，re-dream 等待时间（~25min）虽短但 GPU 到位后不应因 dream 结果阻塞实验启动。Dream\\\\n    D2 结果仍会分析并据此调整 framing/plan，但不作为 P0 实验的 hard gate。准备工作（代码/数据/环境）立即并行推进。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 18:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: Dream D2 分析：best=4/10, median=5/10, worst=4/10。Best 降分因 imagined data 质量问题（非结构性）。6\\\\n    个跨档结构性行动项已确认并持久化。Per D007 advisory gate, 继续推进实验。\\\\n  rationale: D2 三档评分：best=4(R1 因 imagined data suspicious patterns 给 3/10), median=5,\\\\n    worst=4。结构改进被审稿认可（per-benchmark γ_k, ME model, signal survival）。跨档一致的结构性问题：(1)\\\\n    Fisher Information 推导缺失 [B][M][W], (2) DIF 文献缺失 [B][M][W], (3) 零图表 [B], (4) ML\\\\n    calibration 歧义 [M][W], (5) Conformal prediction 未讨论 [M][W], (6) 因果推断类比未形式化 [B][M][W]。数据依赖问题（coverage\\\\n    gap, significance, RRF vs single signal）留待真实实验验证。Best 降分主要因 R1 对 imagined data\\\\n    的 \\\\\\\"suspicious patterns\\\\\\\" 严厉打分——真实实验数据不会有此问题。Per D007 advisory gate, 不阻塞实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: dream_20260513T171200\\\\n    role: re-dream validation\\\\n    result: best=4/10 median=5/10 worst=4/10\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 19:15 UTC\\\\n  summary: HumanEval demoted to appendix case study; main experiments use MMLU/GSM8K/ARC-Challenge\\\\n  rationale: HumanEval paraphrase QC pass rate only 16% (26/164) with Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\\\\n    — code paraphrasing is fundamentally harder than text/math paraphrasing. N=164\\\\n    already flagged as potential 4PL estimation limitation in paper_framing.md. Dream\\\\n    median/worst reviews both identified HumanEval convergence issues (ESS=85, R̂=1.12).\\\\n    Keeping 3 strong benchmarks (MMLU 14K, GSM8K 1.3K, ARC-C) with high QC pass rates\\\\n    provides robust validation. HumanEval results reported in appendix with paraphrase\\\\n    quality caveat.\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_injection\\\\n    role: paraphrase generation\\\\n    result: HumanEval 16% QC pass rate vs expected >80% for text benchmarks\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-13 20:12 UTC\\\\n  summary: Use all paraphrases for SFT injection regardless of QC; QC filtering only\\\\n    for ConStat signal\\\\n  rationale: 'QC pass rate (cosine>0.85 + BLEU<0.3) is systematically low across all\\\\n    benchmarks due to 7B model producing overly lexically similar paraphrases. Two\\\\n    distinct use cases: (1) SFT contamination injection — high-BLEU paraphrases still\\\\n    contaminate the model effectively, QC irrelevant. (2) ConStat signal — needs divergent\\\\n    paraphrases, use QC-passed items only. In our controlled setup we KNOW which items\\\\n    are contaminated (ground truth labels), so n-gram decontamination evasion is motivation,\\\\n    not operational requirement. Re-running generation would cost ~2h on critical\\\\n    path — unacceptable in 12-day sprint. Report QC stats transparently in paper.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_injection\\\\n    role: paraphrase generation\\\\n    result: BLEU>0.3 across benchmarks, QC pass rates expected 15-40%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:45 UTC\\\\n  summary: Real-data IRT pipeline 改用 CmdStanPy Bayesian 推断，弃用 PyTorch MLE\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer CRITICAL：(1) MLE SE 计算失效（Hessian 对角线接近零，49/50 items 回退到上限值）；(2)\\\\n    MLE γ 恢复退化（corr=0.629 vs Stan ~0.94）；(3) 论文 framing 为 Bayesian Calibration，方法论必须与模拟验证一致。复用\\\\n    mvp_sim 已验证的 Stan 模型文件，posterior SD 自然提供 SE。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: PyTorch MLE gamma_corr=0.629, SE全部失效\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_sim_4pl_gamma\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: Stan NUTS theta_corr~0.94, gamma bias<8%\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 00:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: d100_qc_only ablation 列为 P1：noisy vs clean contamination confound 需隔离，但不阻塞\\\\n    Phase 3 主矩阵\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 d100 使用全部 paraphrase（含 QC fail，GSM8K QC 仅 17.3%）导致 noisy\\\\n    contamination confound——若 d100 calibration error 不显著高于 d000，无法区分\\\\\\\"污染无影响\\\\\\\"vs\\\\\\\"噪声稀释信号\\\\\\\"。解决方案：(1)\\\\n    当前 d100 frame 为 conservative/realistic test（真实污染也有噪声）；(2) 补 d100_qc_only（仅 QC\\\\n    pass 样本）作为 P1 ablation，seed=0 主矩阵完成后启动。不阻塞当前 Phase 3。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_d100_05B\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: success, but noisy contamination confound identified\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: 正式实验使用 Simple IRT model，弃用 Analytic ME model\\\\n  rationale: 诊断实验表明 Analytic ME 模型不仅未改善 γ 偏差，反而加剧（59.2% vs Simple 的 57.5%，N=30, σ_e=0.1）。ME\\\\n    模型理论上更优但在有限样本下无法胜过 simple model。exp-006 及后续正式实验统一使用 simple model。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=50 simple model γ bias +23.6%, CI covers true value\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_analytic_me\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ME model γ bias +59.2%, worse than simple model\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 01:19 UTC\\\\n  summary: C1 claim 需加条件限定：γ recovery 依赖 N≥50 且 σ_e≥0.3；论文需含 bias characterization\\\\n    section\\\\n  rationale: 诊断实验显示 N=30/σ_e=0.1 时 γ 正偏差达 57.5%，N=50 仍有 23.6%。Phase 3 预计 N~30-45 处于\\\\n    bias 敏感区。论文必须：(1) C1 加条件限定，(2) 加 simulation calibration section 披露 bias 特性（透明度对审稿人加分），(3)\\\\n    优先报 interval estimates。最终 N vs bias 曲线待 exp-004 sweep 确认。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=50 bias +23.6%, σ_e=0.1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_noise_prop_v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=30 bias +57.5%, σ_e=0.1\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_005_diag_nmodels50\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: N=30 σ_e=0.3 bias only -8.4%, well-calibrated\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like\\\\\\\" claim 需条件限定：无 RL 中间 checkpoint 时降级为 \\\\\\\"significant degradation\\\\\\\"；exp-008\\\\n    代码扩展为 N-regime 支持\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 审查 exp-008 代码发现：当前只支持 SFT vs RL 两个 regime pairwise 对比，2 个数据点无法区分\\\\n    cliff 和 gradual 退化形状。paper_framing.md Figure 2 要求 4 regime heatmap（base/SFT-clean/SFT-contaminated/RL）。决定：(1)\\\\n    代码扩展为 N-regime 矩阵输出；(2) 若提交时无 RL 中间 checkpoint 数据，claim 措辞从 \\\\\\\"cliff-like, not gradual\\\\\\\"\\\\n    降级为 \\\\\\\"significant degradation under RL\\\\\\\"。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: signal survival analysis\\\\n    result: code pass with warning\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 06:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: Min-K++ 参考模型使用 0% dosage fine-tuned model（非裸基座），隔离污染效应\\\\n  rationale: Min-K++ delta = target - reference 的 log-likelihood 差。若 reference = 裸基座，delta\\\\n    混入 fine-tuning 效应 + 污染效应，无法隔离。用 0% dosage model 作 reference，delta 仅反映污染注入的记忆化效应，与论文\\\\n    story（精确量化污染程度）一致。代码注释 `e.g., 0% dosage` 也暗示此意图。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_signal_pipeline\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 需新增 --ref-adapter-path 参数\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 07:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: MC 评估改用 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀（方案 C），不重训模型\\\\n  rationale: SFT 训练格式 \\\\\\\"The answer is X\\\\\\\" 与评估的 \\\\\\\"Answer:\\\\\\\" 前缀不匹配，导致 logprob 退化为 token\\\\n    先验。方案 A（改训练格式）需重训全部模型，DDL 前不可行。方案 B（改生成式）失去 per-item logprob 细粒度，影响 IRT 分析。方案\\\\n    C（评估 prompt 加 \\\\\\\"The answer is\\\\\\\" 前缀）最小侵入：不需重训、保留 logprob 评估、d000 模型也有 5674 条同格式训练数据所以不会退化。需先在\\\\n    d000 上验证方案 C 不引入负面效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d005\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: MMLU=0.293 A-collapse, 证实格式冲突\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d000_s42_v5\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: MMLU=0.418, 同格式但无污染语义相似性\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 09:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 3B GSM8K 崩塌归因为 LoRA SFT CoT 遗忘，排除出 dose-response 分析，作为发现报告\\\\n  rationale: 3B raw GSM8K=60.5%，d000 SFT 后=11.7%（-48.8pp），两个 seed 一致，排除格式/提取问题。根因是\\\\n    LoRA r=16/alpha=32 对 3B 的 CoT 推理过于激进。修复需~20h GPU 重训+eval，DDL 紧张且可能引入新问题。3B MC\\\\n    benchmarks（MMLU=0.634, ARC=0.822）不受影响，保留在 dose-response 中。论文 claim 调整为\\\\\\\"3 model\\\\n    sizes on MC, 2 sizes (0.5B/1.5B) on generative\\\\\\\"，Discussion 讨论 SFT 对 CoT 的 scale-dependent\\\\n    side effect。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K=0.117, 确认 SFT 后 CoT 崩塌\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_raw_gen\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K=0.605, 确认 base model 正常\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 15:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'd005 position bias confound: contamination SFT 将 \\\\\\\"选A\\\\\\\" 比例从 40% 推高到 55%，需\\\\n    position-debiased analysis'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 d005 (5% dosage, noisy QC-fail paraphrases) 模型退化为\\\\\\\"大多选A\\\\\\\"。contamination\\\\n    gap (orig-para accuracy) 被 degeneracy noise 污染，不能直接作为 contamination signal 证据。需要：(1)\\\\n    在 contamination gap 计算前做 position-debiased accuracy；(2) 检查 d100 是否有同样问题；(3) 论文中标注\\\\n    d005 含 QC-fail paraphrases。不重训 d005——d005 是次要剂量点，core result 基于 d000 vs d100。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d005 pred=A 55.7% vs d000 40.4%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_sft_d005_05B_v3\\\\n    role: cause\\\\n    result: noisy SFT with QC-fail paraphrases (D010)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D010\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: 重训 3B d000：降低 LoRA lr 到 5e-5、alpha 到 16，修复 SFT 导致的 CoT 崩塌\\\\n  rationale: 3B d000 GSM8K 12% 确认为 LoRA 超参过激（lr=2e-4, r=16, alpha=32, 全7模块）导致 CoT\\\\n    能力灾难性遗忘。d100-d000=57.7pp 是 artifact，真实 contamination signal ~9pp（raw 60.5 → d100\\\\n    69.7）。重训成本 ~8h GPU，但能补全 3-scale dose-response 证据链，远优于排除 3B + limitation caveat。EMNLP\\\\n    DDL 11天内可控。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 12.0%, CoT 崩塌确认\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d000_s123\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 17.6%, 双seed复现\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_d100\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: GSM8K 69.7%, contamination数据恢复能力\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_3B_raw\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: GSM8K 60.5%, 真实基准\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-008 设计缺陷修正：d100 改为 cross-model 比较，C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like\\\\\\\" 弱化为 \\\\\\\"systematic degradation\\\\\\\"，补\\\\n    RL proxy (Instruct model)\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: (1) d100 AUC=0.5 是 label 伪迹——d005 labels 在 d100 模型上无意义（所有\\\\n    item 都训练过），非信号退化。(2) C2 \\\\\\\"cliff-like RL degradation\\\\\\\" 无真实 RL 数据支撑，合成数据(N=50)显示渐进衰减而非断崖。(3)\\\\n    S2/S4 在 0.5B 全 regime 随机，仅 S1 有效，多信号叙事需 1.5B/3B 验证。修正方案：within-model AUC 限 d005/d025；d000/d100\\\\n    用 cross-model 信号比较；Instruct 模型作 RL proxy；C2 措辞弱化待数据确认。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d100 AUC=0.5 伪迹确认; S2/S4 all-regime 随机; S1 d005 AUC=0.97\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_signal_pipeline\\\\n    role: dependency\\\\n    result: D016 Min-K++ ref model 选择可能导致 S2 失效\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D016\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 16:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'C2 radical reframing: ''cliff-like RL degradation'' → ''method-specific,\\\\n    scale-dependent signal effectiveness''. Delete RL-robust claim from Table 2.'\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-008 Reviewer CRITICAL found 3 fatal issues: (1) d100 AUC=0.5 is\\\\n    labeling artifact (labels fixed to d005 items, d100 contaminates ALL items → no\\\\n    discrimination), not signal failure; (2) real data has NO RL regimes (only SFT\\\\n    dosages d000/d005/d100), synthetic data shows gradual not cliff-like decay; (3)\\\\n    S2 Min-K++ AUC≈0.47 and S4 Self-Critique AUC≈0.5 at 0.5B — only S1 Embedding works\\\\n    (AUC>0.95). RRF degrades to single-signal at 0.5B. Old C2 ''cliff-like under RL''\\\\n    is unsupportable. New framing: signal effectiveness is method-specific and scale-dependent,\\\\n    which is still novel and actionable. RL claims deferred to exp-009.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: S1 AUC>0.95 at d005/0.5B, S2/S4 AUC≈0.5, d100 artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: dependency\\\\n    result: signal pipeline only covers 0.5B — need 1.5B/3B\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-009\\\\n    role: deferred\\\\n    result: RL claims moved here\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:20 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'exp-006 Stan NUTS 不可行(56K params): kill MMLU, 分层策略——小 benchmark 直接 NUTS\\\\n    + MMLU 子采样 1000 items + ADVI fallback'\\\\n  rationale: exp_006_irt_05B_v1 在 MMLU 上跑了 6h 零采样输出。4PL+γ 模型对 14042 items 产生 56175\\\\n    参数，Stan NUTS 完全不可行（需数天到数周）。分层策略：(1) GSM8K(1319 items, ~5300 params)和 ARC(1172\\\\n    items, ~4700 params)直接 NUTS 拟合，可能数小时完成；(2) MMLU 随机子采样 1000 items(~4000 params)做\\\\n    NUTS，用拟合的 γ 对全集推断(TinyBenchmarks Polo 2024 提供先例)；(3) ADVI 作为速度 fallback——100-1000x\\\\n    加速但 CI 可能偏窄，仅作 robustness check 不作主结果。MVP 在小规模合成数据上 NUTS 正常，迁移到真实数据时未预见规模问题。距\\\\n    EMNLP DDL 11 天，不能在不可行计算上耗时。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v1\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: 6h zero samples, 56K params infeasible\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: plan\\\\n    result: core result, needs feasible inference strategy\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D024: GSM8K→负对照; N_models=4不可行→必须跨scale池化; MC benchmarks(MMLU/ARC)为主;\\\\n    加速exp-002多scale信号'\\\\n  rationale: exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k 暴露两个根本问题：(1) 信号在生成式benchmark上无区分力(d000 exposure=0.613\\\\n    vs d005=0.629，几乎无差异)→GSM8K天然抗污染，IRT校准引入噪声(MAE 0.020 > raw 0.003)，应作负对照而非主结果。(2)\\\\n    N_models=4对4PL+γ严重不足(Rhat=1.53, ESS=7, 参数>数据点)，exp-004 identifiability study已预示N≥50才可靠。修复路径：跨scale池化(0.5B+1.5B+3B各4\\\\n    dosage+3 s123 baselines≈15 models)大幅改善identifiability，但需先完成1.5B/3B的exp-002信号计算。同时ARC(MC,1172\\\\n    items)先跑验证MC benchmark上信号是否有效。GSM8K作为'开放式benchmark不需要校准'的正面论证——ContamCal正确识别无污染效应。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_gsm8k\\\\n    role: trigger\\\\n    result: Rhat=1.53, ESS=7, γ CI includes 0, raw MAE=0.003 < IRT MAE=0.020\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: prior_finding\\\\n    result: N≥50 needed for reliable identifiability\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: plan\\\\n    result: must pool across scales, not single-scale\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D014\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:48 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D025: Dream full-mode 分析 — N_models 结构性不足(所有档一致)、novelty 需重新平衡、multi-seed\\\\n    策略必须、SBC 诊断必须'\\\\n  rationale: 'Dream dream_20260514T171536 (full mode) 三档评分: Best 4/6, Median 3/6,\\\\n    Worst 3/6。跨档一致问题(结构性): (1) N_models≈15 远低于 N≥50 阈值 — 必须 multi-seed 池化; (2) novelty\\\\n    ceiling — 标准 explanatory IRT 合成，需重新平衡贡献(提升 signal characterization + Fisher Info\\\\n    到 co-primary); (3) multi-signal vs single-signal — 取决于 1.5B/3B 信号, contingency\\\\n    已有; (4) SFT 弱代理 — 讨论加强; (5) coverage gap — 需 SBC 诊断; (6) missing related work\\\\n    (MIA 文献)。确认行动: A1 multi-seed N_models 策略(target≥30), A2 contribution hierarchy\\\\n    rebalance, A3 SBC 加入 plan, A4 verbatim contamination 加入 P2, A5 hierarchical γ_k\\\\n    考虑, A6 citation 补充。观察项: GSM8K γ 解释(D024已处理), 4PL vs 2PL gap, calibration vs linear\\\\n    regression gap。忽略: causal DAG 形式化(保持 informal), worst-case MCMC failures(imagined\\\\n    data)。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: directly affected — N_models strategy changes fitting approach\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: need multi-seed SFT runs to increase N\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: SBC validation to diagnose coverage gap\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-008\\\\n    role: signal characterization elevated to co-primary\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D022\\\\n  - D023\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D026: Reviewer #16 执行滞后诊断 — seed=123 SFT 最优先, item count mismatch 必须 exp-003\\\\n    前修复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #16 warning: (1) ROADMAP 阻塞状态过期(P0 fix 已验证); (2) 3 GPU 空闲但\\\\n    0 个 seed=123 SFT 启动, DDL-11天; (3) aligned eval vs para_aligned item 集不对齐(14042\\\\n    vs 6596)导致 gap 计算无效; (4) exp-004/005 CPU 续跑未追踪。行动: ROADMAP 全面更新, seed=123 SFT\\\\n    立即调度, item count mismatch 列为 exp-003 前置修复项。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: seed=123 SFT 扩展\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: item count mismatch 影响 gap 计算\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-003\\\\n    role: 依赖 item 集对齐\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: CPU 续跑追踪\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-005\\\\n    role: CPU 续跑追踪\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D025\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: Pooled GSM8K IRT 无效(mixed exposure scales + D018 violation); 新约束:\\\\n    pooled IRT 必须信号同源; ARC 负 gamma 记为 scale-dependent 观察'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #21 critical: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1 gamma=2.14 由三个混淆驱动——(1)\\\\n    0.5B signal-derived exposure (max=0.197) vs 1.5B/3B oracle dosage fallback (max=1.0)\\\\n    混入同一 IRT; (2) 3B GSM8K d000=12% catastrophic forgetting 未排除(D018 违反); (3) 排除函数为死代码。结果标\\\\n    INVALID。新增硬约束: pooled IRT 只接受 exposure 来源一致的模型。ARC 0.5B gamma=-1.87 (负方向) 支持 scale-dependent\\\\n    contamination effects 论述，但 N=4 仅作观察。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1\\\\n    role: INVALID result\\\\n    result: gamma=2.14 driven by confounds\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_arc\\\\n    role: negative gamma observation\\\\n    result: gamma=-1.87 CI[-3.45,-0.27]\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: 1.5B signals pending, blocks valid pooled IRT\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D024\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 20:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D027: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1 标记 INVALID — 混合曝光尺度 + 3B GSM8K artifact\\\\n    + D018 死代码; ARC 负 gamma 作为 scale-dependent 观察记录'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #21 critical: (1) pooled IRT 混合了 signal-derived exposure (0.5B,\\\\n    max=0.197) 和 oracle dosage fallback (1.5B/3B, max=1.0)，两种尺度输入同一 gamma 系数无物理意义;\\\\n    (2) 3B GSM8K d0=12% 是 LoRA 损伤 artifact (D018/D020), 未被排除; (3) D018 排除函数为死代码。新约束:\\\\n    pooled IRT 仅在所有 scale 有同源 signal-derived exposure 时有效。ARC 0.5B gamma=-1.87 CI[-3.45,-0.27]\\\\n    表明小模型污染导致能力退化而非膨胀，支持 scale-dependent framing。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_pooled_gsm8k_v1\\\\n    role: INVALID - mixed exposure + 3B artifact\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_arc\\\\n    role: negative gamma observation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-006\\\\n    role: '新约束: 同源 exposure 才能 pool'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D029\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 21:58 UTC\\\\n  summary: Paraphrase gap 不可作为原始污染信号；ConStat 风格分析必须用 delta-of-deltas\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer #35 独立核实发现：d000 baseline（零污染）已存在显著 paraphrase gap（MMLU: 0.5B\\\\n    +4.49pp, 1.5B +2.43pp），证明 gap 反转是 paraphrase 题目难度偏移，非污染效应。Delta-of-deltas（d100\\\\n    vs d000）在 MC benchmarks 均 <1.5pp，接近噪声。只有 HumanEval 有较强的 delta-of-deltas 信号（+5.38pp）。Gap\\\\n    方向是 benchmark-specific，不存在统一规律。结论：(1) raw gap 不能作为污染信号；(2) ConStat pipeline 若用\\\\n    raw gap 需改为 delta-of-deltas；(3) 论文中不应将 paraphrase gap 作为 MC benchmarks 的主要检测方法。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap MMLU +2.43pp, GSM8K -9.73pp, ARC -1.75pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap MMLU +4.49pp, GSM8K -8.85pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_constat\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: 需验证是否使用 raw gap；若是则结论需修正\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D030\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: 弃用 S3 ConStat 信号，论文只报告 3-signal RRF (S1 embedding + S2 minkpp + S4 selfcritique)\\\\n  rationale: 审计确认 S3 从未参与已有 RRF 融合（全 null），已有 IRT 结果不受影响。即使修复为 delta-of-deltas，MC\\\\n    benchmarks 信号量级 <1.5pp（噪声级），投入产出比极低。修复还需全 dosage × scale 的 paraphrase eval 数据，数据缺口大。弃用\\\\n    S3 并在 Discussion 中解释 paraphrase difficulty confound 反而体现方法论严谨性，且为 Claim 2（信号有效性是\\\\n    method-specific 的）提供额外证据。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_002_constat\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: S3 从未被计算，全 null；raw gap 代码有 bug 但无影响\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_15B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap 证明 paraphrase difficulty confound\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_aligned_batch\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: d000 baseline gap 证明 paraphrase difficulty confound\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D029\\\\n- id: D031\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 22:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp_006 pooled IRT v2 exposure 仅用 s1_embedding，违反 D030 的 3-signal RRF 决策，需紧急修复并重跑\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer critical 发现：load_exp002_signals() 默认 signal_key=\\\\\\\"s1_embedding\\\\\\\"，导致\\\\n    0.5B 和 1.5B 在每个 dosage 获得完全相同的 exposure 值。s2_minkpp 和 s4_selfcritique 是 model-specific\\\\n    的但被忽略。这是 claim-code 不匹配——论文若声称用 3-signal RRF，数据却只基于 s1。修复代码改动量 <10 行，重跑 ~300s/benchmark。Agent\\\\n    已在处理修复。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006\\\\n    role: affected\\\\n    result: exposure计算缺陷，需重跑\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D032\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Pooled IRT N=8 首次结果: ARC γ=-1.46 显著负(CI排除0), GSM8K/MMLU不显著(N不足). ARC确认scale-dependent\\\\n    contamination退化效应, seed=123完成后N→16预期GSM8K收窄'\\\\n  rationale: '0.5B+1.5B跨scale池化(N=8 models)首次产出Paper Table 1数据. ARC CI [-2.51,-0.41]排除0,\\\\n    确认contamination在小模型导致退化而非提升, 与单0.5B γ=-1.87一致且CI收窄(功效提升). GSM8K γ=0.12正方向但CI含0,\\\\n    MMLU γ=-0.21接近0, 均因N=8功效不足. Critical path: seed=123 SFT+eval+signals→N=16 refit,\\\\n    预期CI收窄√2倍. MAE~3.5pp(GSM8K/ARC)与linear baseline接近, 表明IRT校准精度合理.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: ARC γ=-1.46 significant, GSM8K/MMLU n.s.\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-001\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: SFT injection models\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-002\\\\n    role: upstream\\\\n    result: 3-signal RRF exposure scores\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n  - D030\\\\n- id: D033\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:09 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D032 结果需纠偏: Agent 审计发现 pooled IRT 6 个严重问题——coverage 系统性崩塌(25%-62.5% vs\\\\n    95%), GSM8K 跨版本 γ 矛盾, MMLU 未收敛, 缺 oracle baseline. ARC 方向仍成立但 CI 过窄. 启动三线并行修复'\\\\n  rationale: 'Agent 自审发现之前汇报的 γ 取自 joint_fit.global_gamma(层级参数)而非 per-benchmark γ.\\\\n    实际 ARC per-benchmark γ=-2.35 方向更强但 coverage_95=62.5%说明 CI 系统性过窄. GSM8K v2 γ=0.19\\\\n    vs v3 γ=2.10 矛盾(同数据同exposure), v3 PPP=0.0 模型拟合失败. MMLU rhat=1.54/ESS=7 完全不可用.\\\\n    根因: (1) N=8 模型导致 posterior 精度过估 (2) 无 oracle baseline 无法验证 signal-derived exposure\\\\n    有效性 (3) 代码变更导致 GSM8K 跨版本不一致. 修复路径: wider priors + seed=123→N=16 + oracle baseline\\\\n    对照.'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_006_irt_05B_v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: coverage collapse, GSM8K contradictory, MMLU unconverged\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-004\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: sim sweep should inform prior sensitivity\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D032\\\\n  - D027\\\\n  - D028\\\\n- id: D034\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:51 UTC\\\\n  summary: Exposure source 切回 S1-only，废弃 RRF fusion 作为 per-model exposure\\\\n  rationale: RRF 单调性审计确认 4/4 (bench×scale) 组合 RRF_norm 不单调——S2/S4 噪声破坏 S1 的完美单调性 (0.5946→0.8998)。RRF\\\\n    导致 ARC gamma 从 -2.35 恶化到 -7.62，GSM8K gamma 从 0.19 跳到 2.10（ppp=0.0）。S1 embedding\\\\n    单独单调且 v2 结果可作 baseline。Per-item tau 是更好的长期方向但超出当前 scope。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: S1-only gamma=-2.35, monotonic exposure\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: RRF gamma=-7.62, non-monotonic exposure, MAE 0.172\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: RRF gamma=2.10, ppp=0.0\\\\n  - exp_id: D031\\\\n    role: diagnostic\\\\n    result: confirmed v2=S1-only, v3+=RRF fusion\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D030\\\\n  - D031\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D035\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 23:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Oracle baseline 确认 benchmark-dependent contamination effect: ARC 退化 (γ=-2.83)\\\\n    vs GSM8K 膨胀 (γ=+3.77)'\\\\n  rationale: Oracle exposure (dosage/100 as τ, N=15) 结果：ARC gamma=-2.83 显著负（CI排除零），GSM8K\\\\n    gamma=+3.77 显著正。两个方向均被 IRT 正确捕捉。Oracle fit quality 明显优于 signal-derived（ARC MAE\\\\n    0.047 vs 0.115）。论文 framing 需从\\\\\\\"单一膨胀\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"benchmark-dependent effect\\\\\\\"。PPP/coverage\\\\n    仍有系统偏差，需更多 N 或模型改进。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=-2.83, CI[-3.72,-1.89], MAE=0.047\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=+3.77, CI[2.64,4.96], MAE=0.089, rhat=1.012\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: gamma=-7.62, MAE=0.115\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-gsm8k-v4-rrf\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: gamma=2.10, ppp=0.0\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D034\\\\n  - D033\\\\n- id: D036\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 00:03 UTC\\\\n  summary: ARC negative gamma + coverage collapse + 跨种子方差：三大发现要求 framing 适配\\\\n  rationale: 1) ARC γ 在 s42/s123 raw scores 和 oracle IRT 三条独立证据链下均为负。contamination\\\\n    对 ARC 造成 forgetting 而非 inflation，与 MMLU 方向相反。framing 从\\\\\\\"score inflation\\\\\\\"调整为\\\\\\\"benchmark-dependent\\\\n    contamination effects\\\\\\\"——calibration 在两个方向都有效，这是更强的 story。2) Coverage 在 oracle\\\\n    下仍仅 ARC 20%/GSM8K 33%（95% 名义），PPP 在极值（ARC 1.0/GSM8K 0.0）。4PL+gamma additive 模型可能不够充分，需调查：(a)\\\\n    N_models 增大后是否改善 (b) exp-004 sweep 预期 coverage (c) 是否需要更灵活的 IRT 结构。3) 0.5B d100\\\\n    跨种子方差 ARC 7.25pp/MMLU 7.24pp，multi-seed pooling 是必要条件。4) oracle vs RRF 被 N_models\\\\n    差异混淆(15 vs 8)，需匹配 N 重跑。5) GSM8K oracle rhat/ESS 不通过，需更长 chains。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=-2.83, coverage=20%, PPP=1.0\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: gamma=+3.77, coverage=33%, PPP=0.0, diagnostics FAIL\\\\n  - exp_id: exp_001_eval_05B_d100_s123_aligned\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: ARC=36.7% vs s42=29.4%, delta=7.25pp\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-05B-15B-arc-v3-rrf\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: N=8 RRF pooled\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D035\\\\n  - D032\\\\n- id: D037\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 03:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Oracle GSM8K γ=+3.77 显著但校准反而更差——论文需要从\\\\\\\"calibration method\\\\\\\"转向\\\\\\\"detection vs\\\\n    calibration gap\\\\\\\"分析框架\\\\n  rationale: 三个关键证据：(1) Oracle GSM8K γ=+3.77 [2.74,4.71] 显著正向，ARC γ=-1.46 [-2.51,-0.41]\\\\n    显著负向——benchmark-dependent direction confirmed；(2) 即使 oracle 场景，IRT calibrated\\\\n    score MAE=0.092 远劣于 raw score MAE=0.005，coverage 仅 31%，PPP=0 系统性 misfit；(3) S1-only\\\\n    GSM8K γ=+0.12 非显著——signal choice 也影响检测力。核心矛盾：IRT 能检测 contamination signal，但 calibrated\\\\n    scores 反而更差。论文不应声称\\\\\\\"提出校准方法\\\\\\\"，而应系统分析\\\\\\\"检测 ≠ 校准\\\\\\\"的 gap，这是更诚实、更有新意的贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=+3.77 significant, but MAE/coverage/PPP all poor\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: γ=+0.12 non-significant with S1 signal\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-arc\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: γ=-1.46 significant negative, opposite direction\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D038\\\\n  date: 2026-05-15 05:05 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Paper framing pivot: 从 \\\\\\\"calibration method\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"detection + benchmark-dependent\\\\n    characterization\\\\\\\" 分析论文'\\\\n  rationale: 所有已完成 IRT 实验均显示 IRT 校准不优于 raw baseline（GSM8K oracle 4PL MAE 18x worse,\\\\n    ARC 2PL MAE worse, GSM8K S1 2PL MAE 4x worse）。Coverage 在 γ 显著时系统性崩塌（18-33%）。Claim\\\\n    1 \\\\\\\"MAE improvement + nominal coverage\\\\\\\" 与数据直接矛盾。Claim 2/3 实验覆盖率为 0%。但 detection\\\\n    方面有强证据：(1) γ 在 oracle 条件下双 benchmark 显著；(2) 方向 benchmark-dependent（GSM8K+, ARC-）；(3)\\\\n    模型复杂度需匹配任务结构（4PL for MCQ, 2PL for open-ended）；(4) S1 signal 只对 memorization-based\\\\n    tasks 有效。这些构成\\\\\\\"系统性分析 contamination 在 IRT 框架下的行为\\\\\\\"的论文贡献，比\\\\\\\"提出校准方法\\\\\\\"更诚实且更有新意。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-gsm8k-extended-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=+3.77 significant but MAE=0.092 >> raw 0.005\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-oracle-arc-2pl\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=-0.618 significant but MAE=0.076 > raw 0.069, coverage 18%\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-s1only-gsm8k-v2\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: γ=0.17 ns, IRT MAE 4x worse than raw\\\\n  - exp_id: exp006-pooled-arc\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 4PL γ=-1.46 significant, best MAE on ARC but coverage collapse\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D037\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 29209, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01TmbQnQu7r3WCXb7es27xfo","session_id":"e1873933-1306-482a-8d23-78ab423a7040","uuid":"34d099e2-9375-47c1-adcc-da96431eaf0c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:15:25.612Z"}
{"type":"rate_limit_event","rate_limit_info":{"status":"allowed","isUsingOverage":false},"uuid":"c113b5ba-c343-4c74-80a3-af20572cc6ba","session_id":"e1873933-1306-482a-8d23-78ab423a7040"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X182foGAbpQRHCkq1T3c6W","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{Related Work}\n2\t\\label{sec:related}\n3\t\n4\t\\subsection{Benchmark Contamination Detection}\n5\t\\label{sec:related:detection}\n6\t\n7\tDetecting training data contamination in LLMs has produced a diverse methodological landscape spanning at least eight paradigms. Time-based partitioning uses temporal cutoffs to identify potentially leaked items, while canary string insertion (e.g., BIG-Bench) provides direct memorization probes \\citep{chang2025benchmarking}. Min-K\\%++ \\citep{duan2025minkpp} performs membership inference by examining token-level probability distributions, achieving strong detection on pre-training contamination. Time Travel \\citep{oren2024proving} uses guided completion to detect black-box contamination without model weight access. ConStat \\citep{dekoninck2024constat} measures performance gaps between original and paraphrased benchmark items, targeting surface-form memorization. Self-Critique \\citep{wust2025selfcritique} identifies contamination through entropy collapse in model self-evaluations---a signal that, unlike probability-based methods, partially survives reinforcement learning post-training. Hierarchical semantic detection approaches match items at multiple granularity levels to training corpora. KDS \\citep{xu2025kds} uses knowledge distillation signatures to achieve near-perfect detection (Spearman $\\rho = 0.99$) but requires per-model LoRA fine-tuning, limiting scalability.\n8\t\n9\tA critical finding is that detection methods are fragile under RL post-training: \\citet{wang2025fragility} show that GRPO and similar procedures degrade probability-based detection signals substantially, while Self-Critique's entropy-based signal achieves only 0.60--0.70 AUC on RL-trained models \\citep{wust2025selfcritique}. Despite this rich detection toolkit, all existing methods produce binary or continuous \\emph{flags}---they diagnose contamination without prescribing how to adjust the reported accuracy that end-users rely on.\n10\t\n11\t\\subsection{Contamination Impact and Mitigation}\n12\t\\label{sec:related:mitigation}\n13\t\n14\tUnderstanding contamination's quantitative impact has advanced rapidly. \\citet{dong2026dose} establish dose-response curves showing that score inflation scales monotonically with both model size and contamination dosage. \\citet{yang2026rl} further demonstrate that SFT inflates accuracy only on contaminated tasks, while GRPO amplifies inflation even on structurally similar uncontaminated items---a cross-contamination effect that complicates attribution. \\citet{zhang2025forget} show that contamination persists in model weights following standard decontamination, with forgetting curves following scaling laws that make complete removal impractical.\n15\t\n16\tThe mitigation landscape is equally sobering. \\citet{xu2025emperor} systematically evaluate twenty strategies---item rephrasing, option shuffling, filtering, dynamic benchmark construction, and more---across ten LLMs and five benchmarks, finding that none reliably eliminates contamination effects. Dynamic benchmarks such as LiveBench \\citep{white2024livebench} circumvent contamination by generating fresh items but cannot retroactively calibrate existing benchmark scores. Inference-Time Decontamination \\citep{yang2024inference} rewrites items at test time but operates during inference rather than producing post-hoc calibrated scores. DCR \\citep{li2025dcr} is the closest existing method to ours, producing adjusted accuracy via fuzzy inference over detection signals; however, it provides point estimates without uncertainty bounds and does not address signal degradation under RL. \\citet{rao2026silicon} propose a router-worker audit framework that produces contamination flags rather than calibrated scores. Collectively, these findings motivate a paradigm shift: from contamination \\emph{prevention}---which demonstrably fails---to post-hoc statistical \\emph{adjustment} with proper uncertainty quantification.\n17\t\n18\t\\paragraph{Terminological note.} Throughout this paper, ``calibration'' refers to the psychometric sense of score adjustment---recovering decontaminated ability estimates from potentially inflated benchmark scores. This should not be confused with probability calibration in machine learning, where the goal is to align predicted probabilities with empirical frequencies via methods such as Platt scaling or temperature scaling \\citep{guo2017calibration}. ContamCal performs the former: it adjusts reported accuracies for contamination bias rather than recalibrating model confidence scores.\n19\t\n20\t\\subsection{IRT for LLM Evaluation}\n21\t\\label{sec:related:irt}\n22\t\n23\tItem response theory has gained traction as a principled framework for LLM evaluation. \\citet{lalor2024irt} demonstrate that IRT-based evaluation yields more informative model comparisons than raw accuracy. PSN-IRT \\citep{gu2026psnirt} scales this to 41,871 items across 11 benchmarks using a 4PL model with neural network parameter estimation, establishing item difficulty and discrimination profiles but without modeling contamination or producing adjusted scores. \\citet{polo2026growing} fit multidimensional 2PL IRT with anchor items to over 400 models, validating IRT's applicability at scale while identifying practical limitations in the few-examinee regime; contamination is not addressed. ATLAS \\citep{lyu2025atlas} leverages IRT for adaptive testing, reducing evaluation cost through maximally informative item selection. TinyBenchmarks \\citep{polo2024tinybenchmarks} similarly exploits IRT-informed item selection for efficient evaluation. HiBayES \\citep{zhuang2025hibayes} provides hierarchical Bayesian credible intervals over model ability estimates but treats all items as equally trustworthy. \\citet{han2026probing} quantify contamination effects within psychometric evaluations but do not use IRT or produce calibrated scores. Across this body of work, contamination has not been modeled as a covariate within the IRT framework---a gap that ContamCal addresses by augmenting the item response function with exposure parameters.\n24\t\n25\t\\paragraph{Alternative uncertainty quantification.} Conformal prediction \\citep{angelopoulos2023conformal} offers distribution-free coverage guarantees and has been applied to various prediction tasks. We adopt Bayesian IRT over conformal alternatives for three reasons. First, contamination-specific parameters ($\\gamma_k$) yield directly interpretable causal quantities---``contamination inflates scores by $\\gamma_k$ units on benchmark $k$''---whereas conformal intervals lack such structural decomposition. Second, the posterior over all latent variables naturally propagates measurement error into credible intervals without requiring a separate calibration set. Third, conformal prediction assumes exchangeability of data points, which is violated in the contaminated setting: response distributions for contaminated items are systematically shifted relative to clean items. Conformal methods may nonetheless prove valuable in complementary LLM evaluation contexts where exchangeability holds.\n26\t\n27\t\\subsection{Item Compromise in Educational Measurement}\n28\t\\label{sec:related:edumeasure}\n29\t\n30\tThe psychometric literature has long addressed item compromise---the unauthorized disclosure of test content prior to administration. \\citet{eckerly2017} develops IRT models that incorporate compromise indicators to simultaneously estimate item parameters and compromise effects, while \\citet{sinharay2017} proposes likelihood ratio and score tests for detecting item preknowledge. The explanatory IRT tradition \\citep{deboeck2004,adams1997} provides the theoretical foundation for embedding external covariates within item response functions, and \\citet{mislevy1986} establishes Bayesian estimation procedures for such augmented models.\n31\t\n32\tAdapting this tradition to LLM evaluation requires three structural adaptations detailed in \\S\\ref{sec:stage2}.\n33\t\n34\t\\paragraph{Differential item functioning.} The per-benchmark exposure parameter $\\gamma_k$ in ContamCal can be interpreted as measuring differential item functioning (DIF) between contaminated and clean model populations. DIF---the phenomenon whereby examinees of equal ability but different group membership respond differently to an item---was formalized by \\citep{holland1993dif}, with IRT-based detection procedures developed by \\citet{thissen1993dif} and logistic regression frameworks established by \\citet{zumbo1999dif}. In this view, $\\gamma_k$ functions as a uniform DIF parameter capturing systematic advantage conferred by exposure. However, ContamCal extends the classical DIF paradigm in two respects: group membership is determined by continuous exposure scores from Stage~1 rather than discrete demographic categories, and DIF is modeled with benchmark-specific $\\gamma_k$ parameters, each with independent priors, fitted separately per benchmark.\n35\t\n36\t\\paragraph{Positioning.} ContamCal bridges contamination detection (which flags but does not calibrate), IRT-based LLM evaluation (which models ability but ignores contamination), and educational item compromise models (which handle leaked items but assume independent examinees with binary exposure). Table~\\ref{tab:positioning} summarizes the capabilities of representative methods.\n37\t\n38\t\\begin{table}[t]\n39\t\\centering\n40\t\\small\n41\t\\begin{tabular}{lcccc}\n42\t\\toprule\n43\t\\textbf{Method} & \\textbf{Detects} & \\textbf{Calibrates} & \\textbf{UQ} & \\textbf{RL-robust} \\\\\n44\t\\midrule\n45\tMin-K\\%++ & \\checkmark & & & \\\\\n46\tConStat & \\checkmark & & & \\\\\n47\tSelf-Critique & \\checkmark & & & \\checkmark \\\\\n48\tKDS & \\checkmark & & & ? \\\\\n49\tDCR & \\checkmark & \\checkmark & & \\\\\n50\tPSN-IRT & & & & \\\\\n51\tHiBayES & & & \\checkmark & \\\\\n52\t\\textbf{ContamCal} & \\checkmark & \\checkmark & \\checkmark & ?$^\\dagger$ \\\\\n53\t\\bottomrule\n54\t\\multicolumn{5}{l}{\\footnotesize $^\\dagger$Designed for RL robustness via uncertainty propagation; empirical validation pending (exp-008).}\n55\t\\end{tabular}\n56\t\\caption{Capability comparison of contamination-aware evaluation methods. UQ = uncertainty quantification via credible intervals. RL-robust = maintains effectiveness after RL post-training.}\n57\t\\label{tab:positioning}\n58\t\\end{table}\n59\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BpzLPkCye3b9nD28gd9j1g","session_id":"e1873933-1306-482a-8d23-78ab423a7040","uuid":"8739156f-5f5e-4087-92bf-6d65a7b5f680","timestamp":"2026-05-15T06:15:25.078Z"}
